config CWBEAT_BATTERY
	bool "CWbeat stock battery sampling filter"
	depends on ADC_WS9652A
	help
	  Read seven raw battery ADC samples and apply the stock trimmed mean,
	  masking to six bits after averaging. This does not convert to voltage
	  or percentage, or implement a charging policy.
